abstract: "Python code, derived inputs, result tables and figures for the analysis of the Romanian records of the ECHO citizen-science soil network (ECHOREPO, 1,091 samples, 444 collectors): contribution and data quality, spatial autocorrelation, collector effects, spatial representation, comparison with LUCAS 2018 topsoil pH."
